  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "EAP: fix PEAP decoder",
  "description": "Since fdf55aaa we use `tls_group` to support tracking multiple TLS layers inside EAP which the PEAP decoder needs to be taught about.\n\nThis deals with the `DISSECTOR_ASSERT(tbv && tvb->initialized)` explosions you see when trying to decode a PEAP frame (`packet-peap.c:dissect_peap():eap_tvb` is `NULL`)...as well as actually then goes on to decode the PEAP frame which is desirable.",
